# FortiTLDR sources. One URL per line; lines starting with # are ignored.
# A newly added URL is silently baselined on its first run (no email flood).
# Full list of FortiGuard feeds: https://www.fortiguard.com/rss-feeds

# PSIRT security advisories (FG-IR-xx-xxx): vulnerabilities in Fortinet products
https://filestore.fortinet.com/fortiguard/rss/ir.xml

# Outbreak Alerts: actively exploited threats and the Fortinet coverage for them
https://filestore.fortinet.com/fortiguard/rss/outbreakalert.xml

# Threat Signal reports: emerging threats and recommended actions
https://filestore.fortinet.com/fortiguard/rss/threatsignal.xml

# Firmware releases: new builds for FortiOS, FortiManager, FortiAnalyzer, etc.
https://support.fortinet.com/rss/firmware.xml

